  msgCooldownV2: Wait {0} seconds before the next photo.
  msgDailyLimitV2: You've sent {0} photos today. Try again tomorrow, or type the
    product in.
  msgBusyV2: Photo look-up is busy today. Type the product in, or try again tomorrow.
  msgDownV2: The photo couldn't be looked up.
  msgNothingV2: We couldn't recognise a product in this photo. Retake it showing
    the front of the pack, or type it in.
  msgNoListV2: Found {0}, but couldn't find an ingredient list. You can type it in.
